        "text": "Setting up SSH\nWe will configure SSH on a computer running Ubuntu Server 22.04.2 LTS as the host operating system.\nThroughout the entire book, we used SSH connections several times, and showed you how to create\nan SSH key pair in Chapter 11 , Working with Virtual Machines , when we worked with cloud-init. This\ntime, we will show you how to install OpenSSH , how to enable SSH, and how to modify some of its\nconfiguration defaults.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Installing and configuring OpenSSH on Ubuntu\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
